.TH BIGFILES 1 "2026-10-24" "cools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bigfiles \- list files whose line count exceeds a threshold
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bigfiles
[\fIDIRECTORY\fR] \fB--max\fR \fILINES\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Recursively scan a directory and print files with more than LINES lines.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --max N
Line threshold.
.TP
.B --type KIND
Filter by kind: text, binary, code (default: all).
.TP
.B --ext LIST
Comma-separated extensions.
.TP
.B --magic LIST
Comma-separated hexadecimal magic numbers.
.SH OUTPUT
LINES<TAB>PATH
.SH EXAMPLES
bigfiles . --max 500 --type text --ext c,h
.SH SEE ALSO
changed(1), fileinfo(1), contextpack(1)
